{
  "title": "STS / SCP · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "임시 자격 증명과 조직 수준 권한 경계를 구별한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>STS <span class=\"full-name\">(Security Token Service)</span> / SCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Service Control Policy)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerole\">AssumeRole</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerolewithsaml-and-assumerolewithwebidentity\">AssumeRoleWithSAML and AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#external-id-and-confused-deputy\">External ID and Confused Deputy</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#session-duration-tags-and-source-identity\">Session Duration, Tags and Source Identity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations and Organizational Units</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">Service Control Policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#allow-lists-and-deny-lists\">Allow Lists and Deny Lists</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>54 / 62</span></div><h1>STS <span class=\"full-name\">(Security Token Service)</span> / SCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Service Control Policy)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerole\">STS</a>는 임시 Security Credentials를 발급한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 멤버 계정이 사용할 수 있는 권한의 최대 범위를 제한한다. 두 기능은 함께 사용될 수 있지만 Credential 발급과 조직 권한 제한이라는 역할이 다르다.</p><p>임시 Credential은 Access Key ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>, Secret Access Key, Session Token과 만료 시각을 가진다. Role Trust가 허용해도 호출 권한·Session 조건·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>가 요청을 막을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"역할 신뢰와 조직 제한\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>역할 신뢰와 조직 제한</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Temporary access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Caller principal</strong><small>AssumeRole 권한</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Role <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">Trust Policy</a></strong><small>허용 Principal·조건</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerole\">STS</a> Session</strong><small>만료 있는 Credential</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Maximum permissions</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations</a> hierarchy</strong><small>Root·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">OU</a>·Account</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a></strong><small>최대 허용 범위 제한</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Role permissions</strong><small>범위 안에서 실제 Allow 필요</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 Credential을 발급하거나 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 권한을 직접 부여하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"assumerole\"><h2>AssumeRole<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerole\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>허용된 Principal이 Role Session을 만들고 임시 Credential을 받는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">Trust Policy</a>는 누가 Role을 맡을 수 있는지 정하고 Permission Policy는 Role의 작업 범위를 정한다. Cross-account에서는 호출자 권한과 대상 Trust를 함께 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"assumerolewithsaml-and-assumerolewithwebidentity\"><h2>AssumeRoleWithSAML and AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#assumerolewithsaml-and-assumerolewithwebidentity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">SAML</a> Assertion 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">OIDC</a> Token으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">Federation</a>한다. User의 장기 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Key를 배포하지 않고 외부 인증 결과로 임시 권한을 제공한다. Token의 Issuer·Audience·Subject 조건을 신뢰 정책에서 제한한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"external-id-and-confused-deputy\"><h2>External ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span> and Confused Deputy<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#external-id-and-confused-deputy\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>외부 서비스가 고객 계정 Role을 사용할 때 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#external-id-and-confused-deputy\">External ID</a> 조건으로 의도한 고객 요청을 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#external-id-and-confused-deputy\">External ID</a> 자체는 Password 대신 쓰는 비밀이 아니다. 서비스 통합에서는 SourceArn·SourceAccount 같은 조건도 목적에 맞게 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"session-duration-tags-and-source-identity\"><h2>Session Duration, Tags and Source Identity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#session-duration-tags-and-source-identity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Session 만료·Role Chaining 제한과 Tag 전달 조건을 확인한다. Session Tag는 ABAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Attribute-Based Access Control)</span>에, Source Identity는 추적에 활용한다. 만료된 Token으로 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 계속 호출할 수 없으므로 SDK의 Credential 갱신을 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"organizations-and-organizational-units\"><h2>Organizations and Organizational Units<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>여러 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 계정을 Root·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">OU</a>·Account 계층으로 관리한다. 계정은 강한 리소스·Billing 경계이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">OU</a>는 정책 적용 집합이다. Consolidated Billing과 권한 위임은 별도 기능이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"service-control-policies\"><h2>Service Control Policies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>멤버 계정의 Principal이 사용할 수 있는 최대 권한을 제한하며 자체적으로 권한을 부여하지 않는다. 상위 계층의 제한을 하위 Allow로 우회할 수 없다. Management Account와 Service-linked Role 등 적용 예외를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"allow-lists-and-deny-lists\"><h2>Allow Lists and Deny Lists<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#allow-lists-and-deny-lists\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Allow-list 전략은 허용 범위를 명시하고 Deny-list는 기본 허용 범위에서 금지 Action을 제거한다. 계층별 적용 결과와 필수 관리 작업을 검토한다. 정책 변경 전 Test <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">OU</a>에서 영향을 확인하면 계정 잠김 위험을 줄일 수 있다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>운영 계정의 Backup 삭제를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>로 제한하고 복구 담당자는 AssumeRole로 필요한 임시 권한을 받게 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>만 생성해서 복구 권한이 생기는 것은 아니다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>교차 계정 접근은 신뢰 정책과 호출자 측 권한을 함께 검토한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_temp.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_temp.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/organizations/latest/userguide/orgs_manage_policies_scps.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">organizations/latest/userguide/orgs_manage_policies_scps.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q062\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q063\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q063/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q089\" data-question=\"Q089\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q089</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q089/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only NAT gateway availability</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The role trust policy and permission to call AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The target bucket policy and the role&#x27;s S3 permissions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, E</strong> · 교차 계정 역할을 맡을 수 있어야 하고, 맡은 뒤 리소스 액세스 정책도 맞아야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q061\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q068\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">이전 용어 <b>Storage Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">다음 용어 <b>Subnet / CIDR</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
